This project uses **Reliant Forge** (github.com/reliant-labs/forge), run as `{{.CLI}}`. It is not Atlassian Forge, Foundry's `forge` (Solidity) or Laravel Forge; do not use their commands.

The project guide is `AGENTS.md` at the repository root; read it first. The skills live in the `{{.CLI}}` binary, so they always match the version this project pins:

1. Run `{{.CLI}} skill load forge` first.
2. Look up a topic with `{{.CLI}} skill search <query>`, then `{{.CLI}} skill load <name>`.
3. Before concluding forge cannot do something, run `{{.CLI}} project capabilities`.
